{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KwDfzVqoMWSuJAEpgknGJm","type":"tool_result","content":"126:## Day by day\n127:**D1-D7 (PS -> +JScript -> +Batch -> +VBScript -> +Python -> +Bash -> +Node, 469 ids)**: D1 collection ATT&CK cost 5 wrong before\n128:`T1555.003`; D2 handoff = `staged_chain`, 7 wrong ATT&CK guesses; **D3 ~1 h 45 min, ~127 rejected probes** on batch\n129:expansion/control labels -> NAMING LAWS; D4 VBS control probed one field at a time (4 wrong); D5-D6 0 wrong (~4 min; stage_count =\n130:plan field); D7 469/469 in ~100 s, TT missed 15 ids on new reps + one `rate_limited` body saved as the zip.\n131:**D8-D15 (+PHP polyglot & hosts, Lua/SCT/OpenResty, MOF, TS, AutoIt, AppleScript, MSBuild, Perl; 615 -> 1026 ids)**: D8 introduced\n132:v=3 (copy role/attack/adapter/profiles, don't derive); 6 ids lost once to hyphenated family names. Each new language = 4 polyglots\n133:(benign_utility/downloader/launcher/staged_chain; attack none/T1105/T1059/T1059; adapter local_parser/http_client/process_builder/\n134:operation_graph; campaign `<LANG>-<8hex>`, url `https://<lang>-<10hex>.example.invalid/stage`, file_path\n135:`/tmp/huntress-<lang>/.<16hex>.stage`) + sometimes one `host-<profile>-<lang>` file. D14 family had an underscore (`msbuild_xml`)\n136:and its prompt's ATT&CK (T1127.001) was NOT the answer (plan said T1059). D8-D14 all modes first try. D15: single 1026/1026 at\n137:T+17 s; TT and Mastery (5 sets) missed ~25 batch-expansion ids -> the label-regime axis; CORRECT ~5.5 min after start.\n138:**D16-D17 (+Ruby `.rb` + `ruby_rack` host + 2 Bash; then +AutoHotkey `.ahk`, no host; 1095 -> 1139 ids)**: equivalence and\n139:network-reconcile prompts never asked. Ruby `DESCRIPTOR_<8HEX> = \"..\"`, AHK `descriptor_<8hex> := \"..\"`, plan-verbatim. D16\n140:single lost 5 probes on batch expansion (statement regime keyed on `started_at`), CORRECT T+4 min 23 s; D17 carried solver T+13 s.\n141:**D18 Orphan Process (+4 Apps Script `.gs` + `host-google-docs-sidebar-google-apps-script.gs`; 1194 ids)**: process-tree/PPID\n142:prompt = flavour (no telemetry). Twist = SPLIT carrier (marker without data + multi-line `[..].join(\"\")` array, see Variant\n143:axes); host = Docs `onOpen_` menu -> HtmlService \"Document Decryption\" sidebar lure. `language=google_apps_script`, attack parent\n144:T1059 (not .007). Carried solver left 55 ids planless -> race harness walked role/attack enums (~30 rejected probes); array-join\n145:patch -> CORRECT **T+54 s**; TT 11.7 s, Mastery (5970 ids) 17.7 s first try.\n146:**D19 Sharp Practice (base `managed-assembly-bridge`; +4 `polyglot-csharp_script-{benign-utility,downloader,launcher,\n147:staged-chain}.csx` + `host-aspx-inline-csharp-csharp-script.csx`; 55 new ids, 1249 total, 137 members, no new Bash)**: prompt\n148:\"a Roslyn C# script and an inline ASPX host act as a bridge that carries managed code back into the script corpus ... resolve\n149:each static handoff, work out where the bridge actually leads\" -- no new question kind; \"where it leads\" = each file's\n150:`next-language` (powershell/jscript/batch/vbscript, plan-verbatim). The 4 polyglots are a plain one-line v=3 (`// HUNTRESS_\n151:ANALYSIS_V1:<FRAG|HEX|B64|HB64>-..` + `string descriptor_<8hex> = \"..\";` + `BuildPlan_<id>() => new Dictionary<..>`) and the\n152:carried solver answered all 44. **Twist = NESTED escaped carrier**: the `.csx` host file is really an ASPX page (`<%@ Page\n153:Language=\"C#\" %>`, `<script runat=\"server\">`) whose `EmbeddedCsx_<id>` C# string holds the whole inner csx with `\\n` and `\\\"`\n154:escapes -> marker regex captured `<hex>\\n#nullable` (peel failed), descriptor regex missed `\\\"` -> 11 host ids planless.\n155:Plan: `language=csharp_script`, campaign `CSHARP_SCRIPT-<8hex>`, url `https://csharp_script-<10hex>.example.invalid/stage`,\n156:host_profile `aspx_inline_csharp`, role staged_chain with steps `decode_configuration>return_configuration` (role != steps